Because if Kafka is down, your payment update is not lost.

6. Reconciliation Job (Very Important)

Even with webhooks, create a scheduled job.

Example:

Every 15 minutes:

Find payments:

status=PENDING
AND
created_time > 15 minutes

Call gateway:

GET /payment/status/PAY123

Gateway response:

SUCCESS

Update:

Payment SUCCESS

